       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     CCODEDEL.
       AUTHOR.         C.I.HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   4/1/86.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
      *REMARKS.
      *D   THIS SUBPROGRAM DELETES A CORPORATE CODE OUT OF THE STORES
      *D   DATABASE.  IT DOES NOT DISPLAY A SCREEN.  IT DOES NOT PERFORM
      *D   ANY EDITING.  THE CALLING PROGRAM IS RESPONSIBLE FOR ANY EDITING.
      *D   THE CORPORATE CODE PASSED WILL BE SLICED OUT OF THE DATABASE
      *D   REGARDLESS OF WHAT MIGHT EXIST IN OTHER DATASETS REFERENCING
      *D   THAT CORP CODE.
      *C
      *C   09/14/93   JS BUNGO  REQUEST 6420.
      *C     ADDED CALL TO SJOBPCOD TO DELETE A CODE FROM MMISA
      *C     PM-JOBPLAN WHEN A CODE IS DELETED FROM STORES.
      *C
      *C   09/20/93   JS BUNGO  REQUEST 5643.
      *C     ADDED CALL TO SCCLKCHG TO DELETE A CODE FROM MMISA
      *C     CORP-CODE-LINK AND CC-NOTE-MSTR WHEN A CODE IS DELETED
      *C     FROM STORES.
      *C
      *C   01/28/94   JS BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CALL TO SCCALTCH TO DELETE A CODE FROM THE
      *C     ALTERNATE KEY FILE WHEN A CODE IS DELETED FROM STORES.
      *C
      *C   09/12/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     RECOMPILE PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   09/26/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     DELETE ENTRIES FROM DRCVCORR AND DCHATNO.
      *C
      *C   1/14/97    BILL ROXBURY REQ #95-012
      *C     DELETE ENTRIES FROM NEW RECEIVING FILE (MCFLCSRCPT).
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DWLITEM-CD-O
