       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  DWLITEM-CD-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DWLITEM-CD-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1500  OF MCFLCS1502.

       FD  DMANPART-CD-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DMANPART-CD-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3600  OF MCFLCS3603.

       FD  DDESC-CD-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDESC-CD-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1400  OF MCFLCS1401.

       FD  DDESC2-CD-O
